#{@user_email} has requested an API token.

Their stated use:

= @requested_use

- history_notes = []
- history_notes << pluralize(@prior_revoked_count, "previously revoked token") if @prior_revoked_count > 0
- history_notes << pluralize(@prior_denied_count, "previously denied token") if @prior_denied_count > 0
- if history_notes.any?
  Heads up: this user has #{history_notes.to_sentence}.

Review and approve/deny this request in the admin panel.
